# NETRUN pay-per-GB v2 — started by netrun-pergb-certs.path: reload the
# per-GB haproxy when the certificates it serves changed (see
# deploy/node/netrun-pergb-certs-reload.sh). Never touches the per-piece haproxy.
[Unit]
Description=NETRUN per-GB haproxy: reload after a certificate change
After=netrun-pergb-haproxy.service

[Service]
Type=oneshot
ExecStart=/bin/bash /opt/netrun/deploy/node/netrun-pergb-certs-reload.sh
